+// far snow does not shimmer with sub-pixel points. Integer cells per UV unit (the seam
+// law). Returns the glint, 0..1; the caller adds it to the ALBEDO, so the sun lights it and
+// an overcast puts it out for free.
+float OroSnowSparkle(float2 uv, float per, float3 nrmW, float3 toCam, float3 toSun, float k, float fade)
